---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="For Restaurant Owners | Zesti Kitchen (Demo) – Lekki, Lagos"
  description="How this 2-tap restaurant system turns Instagram followers into paying diners with zero commission. Google Business Profile setup checklist."
>
  <div class="py-12 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      {/* Header */}
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-lavender-deep dark:text-lavender-electric font-bold">
          ★ The Restaurant Owner Pitch
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-charcoal dark:text-cream font-bold mt-2 text-balance">
          Stop Losing 25% to Food Apps. <br />
          <span class="text-lavender-deep dark:text-lemon italic font-serif">Own Your Orders</span> in Two Taps.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-muted dark:text-cream/80 text-base sm:text-lg mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          This demo website is built for Nigerian restaurant owners who want direct WhatsApp orders, instant table reservations, and a phone-friendly admin to change prices without calling a developer.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* The 4 Big Wins for Restaurant Owners */}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-20">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-squircle bg-white dark:bg-charcoal-100 border border-charcoal/10 dark:border-cream/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold mb-4">
              ₦
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-cream mb-2">
              0% Commission on Orders
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-cream/70 leading-relaxed">
              Third-party delivery aggregators charge up to 25% on every order. With this system, diners tap your menu and their order arrives pre-formatted directly on your business WhatsApp. You keep 100% of the revenue.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-charcoal/10 dark:border-cream/10 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-basil dark:text-emerald-400">
            ✓ Full profit margins retained
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-squircle bg-white dark:bg-charcoal-100 border border-charcoal/10 dark:border-cream/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-lavender-electric text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold mb-4">
              ⚡
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-cream mb-2">
              Order or Reserve in 2 Taps
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-cream/70 leading-relaxed">
              Every extra screen cuts conversion by 20%. Our system eliminates app downloads, login passwords, and checkout questionnaires. One tap adds the dish, one tap sends it on WhatsApp.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-charcoal/10 dark:border-cream/10 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-lavender-deep dark:text-lavender-electric">
            ✓ Sub-5-second checkout
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-squircle bg-white dark:bg-charcoal-100 border border-charcoal/10 dark:border-cream/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-basil text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold mb-4">
              📱
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-cream mb-2">
              Mobile Admin for Kitchen Staff
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-cream/70 leading-relaxed">
              Ran out of catfish? Open your phone, flip the 'Sold Out' toggle, and the public site reflects it instantly with undo toasts. Change prices, update hours, or view reservations on your phone in seconds.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-charcoal/10 dark:border-cream/10 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-lemon dark:text-lemon">
            ✓ Zero developer dependency
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-squircle bg-white dark:bg-charcoal-100 border border-charcoal/10 dark:border-cream/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-chilli text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold mb-4">
              🖨️
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-cream mb-2">
              Table QR Menus & Print Sheets
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-cream/70 leading-relaxed">
              Generate QR codes for every dining table with table numbers pre-encoded. Print an A4 sheet of table stand cards directly from the browser. Diners scan and order without waving for a waiter.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-charcoal/10 dark:border-cream/10 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-chilli dark:text-rose-400">
            ✓ Faster table turnover
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Google Business Profile Setup Checklist (SEO & Local Requirement) */}
      <section class="mb-20 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-squircle bg-charcoal text-cream border border-lemon/30 shadow-2xl" aria-labelledby="gbp-checklist-heading">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mb-8">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-lemon font-bold">
            ★ Local SEO Playbook
          </span>
          <h2 id="gbp-checklist-heading" class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-cream font-bold mt-1 text-balance">
            Google Business Profile (GBP) Setup Checklist
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-cream/70 mt-2">
            A high-converting website is only half the battle. Follow this 10-step checklist to dominate Google Search and Google Maps in your local area.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ol class="space-y-4 text-sm text-cream/85">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">1</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Claim and verify the business listing:</strong> Use postcard or instant video verification on Google Business Profile.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">2</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Set categories accurately:</strong> Set Primary category to <code>Restaurant</code> or <code>Nigerian Restaurant</code>; add secondary tags (<code>Barbecue Restaurant</code>, <code>Grill</code>).
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">3</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Exact NAP Consistency:</strong> Match Name, Address, and Phone number exactly across Google, Instagram, and this website.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">4</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Accurate Hours & Holiday Shifts:</strong> Set standard operating hours and add public holiday closures ahead of time.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">5</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Add Menu and WhatsApp Links:</strong> Link the Menu URL directly to <code>/menu</code> and secondary link to your WhatsApp number.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">6</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Upload High-Resolution Real Photos:</strong> Minimum 10 real food shots, exterior entrance, seating, and kitchen staff.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">7</span>
            <div>
              <strong>UTM-Tagged Website Link:</strong> Use <code>https://yourdomain.com.ng/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp</code> to measure search visitors accurately.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">8</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Reply to Every Review:</strong> Thank positive reviews within 24 hours; respond professionally and empathetically to critical feedback.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-chilli text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">9</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Hard Rule: NEVER Buy or Fabricate Reviews:</strong> Google actively penalizes fake review clusters. Ask real diners at the table or send a review link after WhatsApp delivery.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3.5 rounded-squircle-sm bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">10</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Domain Recommendation:</strong> For authentic Nigerian local trust and Google NG rank boost, register a <code>.ng</code> or <code>.com.ng</code> domain (e.g. <code>demo-kitchen.example.ng</code>).
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      {/* Pricing / Monthly Retainer Placeholder */}
      <section class="mb-20" aria-labelledby="pricing-heading">
        <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-lavender-deep dark:text-lavender-electric font-bold">
            ★ Simple Transparent Pricing
          </span>
          <h2 id="pricing-heading" class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-charcoal dark:text-cream font-bold mt-1 text-balance">
            The Monthly Managed Retainer
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-cream/70 mt-2">
            No massive upfront capital. A single predictable monthly plan covering everything your restaurant needs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto p-8 rounded-squircle bg-white dark:bg-charcoal-100 border-2 border-lemon shadow-xl">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-cream">All-In-One Plan</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-lemon text-charcoal font-bold text-xs uppercase">Most Popular</span>
          </div>

          <div class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold text-charcoal dark:text-cream mb-1 tabular-nums">
            ₦50,000 <span class="text-sm font-sans font-normal text-muted dark:text-cream/60">/ month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted dark:text-cream/70 mb-6">
            Includes high-speed Cloudflare hosting, mobile admin, menu updates, and technical support.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-charcoal dark:text-cream/90 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Cloudflare Pages CDN hosting with 99.99% uptime</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Unlimited 2-tap WhatsApp orders (0% commission)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Table QR code generation & printable menus</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Google Business Profile audit & monthly optimization</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Monthly menu price adjustments & photo uploads</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Priority WhatsApp technical support</li>
          </ul>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/2348000000000?text=Hi%2C%20I%20am%20a%20restaurant%20owner%20interested%20in%20the%20managed%20monthly%20plan."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-full bg-charcoal text-lemon hover:bg-black font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-center block shadow cursor-pointer"
          >
            Request Private Consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* White-Label Rapid Preview Guide */}
      <section class="p-8 rounded-squircle bg-cream-100 dark:bg-charcoal-50 border border-charcoal/15 dark:border-cream/15">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal dark:text-cream mb-2">
          White-Label Prospect Previews in Under 1 Hour
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-cream/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          All branding tokens, colors, dishes, phone numbers, and WhatsApp links are isolated inside <code>brand.json</code>. To pitch an actual restaurant prospect (e.g. "Mama Cass" or "The Place"):
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted dark:text-cream/80 font-mono">
          <li>Duplicate <code>brand.json</code> or edit its values (name, primary colors, phone, menu items).</li>
          <li>Deploy behind an unguessable private preview URL (e.g. <code>preview-xyz.pages.dev</code>) with <code>noindex: true</code>.</li>
          <li>Always obtain the restaurant's consent before using their trade name or logo.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

